1
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:05,760
What am I sitting on?
我是坐到什麼東東啊？

2
00:00:06,270 --> 00:00:07,730
Top of the world?
世界頂端？

3
00:00:08,070 --> 00:00:09,830
Dock of the bay?
河堤碼頭？ （歌詞）

4
00:00:10,870 --> 00:00:11,930
I'm out.
想不出來了

5
00:00:14,010 --> 00:00:15,030
Oh,undies!
內褲

6
00:00:19,210 --> 00:00:21,050
Whose are they?
老實說，誰的？

7
00:00:21,280 --> 00:00:23,410
-Whose are they? -Not mine.
誰的？ 不是我的

8
00:00:23,690 --> 00:00:25,350
Joey's! Got to be Joey's.
是喬伊的，一定是他的

10
00:00:30,190 --> 00:00:31,180
They're mine.
的確是我的

11
00:00:31,460 --> 00:00:34,260
See,Joey's. They're Joe-Joe-Joey's.
看吧？就是喬伊的，喬…伊的

12
00:00:35,060 --> 00:00:36,360
Why are they here?
怎麼會在這裡？

13
00:00:37,030 --> 00:00:38,620
I don't know.
我不知道…

14
00:00:40,940 --> 00:00:42,370
Because I'm Joey.
因為我是喬伊

15
00:00:43,410 --> 00:00:44,460
I'm disgusting.
我生性齷齪 

16
00:00:44,710 --> 00:00:47,440
I take my underwear off in other people's homes.
隨便在別人家脫內褲

17
00:00:49,310 --> 00:00:52,440
Get them out of here. What's wrong with you?
快拿走，你哪裡有病啊？

18
00:00:52,552 --> 00:00:53,817
對啊 好惡

19
00:00:56,050 --> 00:00:58,040
-Take them! -I got them.
拿去啊

20
00:00:58,650 --> 00:01:01,250
You can touch them. They're yours.
喬伊，你幹嘛不敢碰 這是你的內褲

21
00:01:06,560 --> 00:01:08,120
Chandler? A word?
錢德，借一步說話 好

22
00:01:16,570 --> 00:01:20,840
I'm tired of covering for you two. This has got to stop.
我受夠了 不想再幫你們說謊了 這種鳥事不能再發生了

24
00:01:22,640 --> 00:01:24,810
Tighty-whiteys? What are you,8?
而且還是白色三角褲？ 你8歲嗎？

26
00:01:26,350 --> 00:01:28,410
Thank you,Joey,so much.
謝謝你，喬伊，感激不盡

27
00:01:28,680 --> 00:01:30,150
You're not welcome,okay?
我家不歡迎你

28
00:01:30,690 --> 00:01:34,250
Look,I hate this. You guys keep embarrassing me.
我討厭這樣 你們害我拚命出醜

30
00:01:34,490 --> 00:01:38,020
Yesterday,Rachel found your razor in our bathroom.
昨天瑞秋在這裡的浴室 看到你的剃刀

31
00:01:38,260 --> 00:01:42,360
I said it was mine, and that I was playing a woman in a play.
我只好說是我的 還說我要在話劇裡演女人

34
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:46,360
Then one thing led to another,and....
結果還得一不做二不休

35
00:01:51,840 --> 00:01:54,870
And around the ankles, that is a tough spot.
連腳踝周圍都剃光了 那裡很不好刮哩

36
00:01:55,110 --> 00:01:56,810
It was. All right,listen
沒錯，告訴你們，我不能…

37
00:01:57,050 --> 00:01:59,450
All this lying has been hard on us too.
我們要說謊也不好受

38
00:01:59,680 --> 00:02:02,280
Yeah,I bet all the sex makes it easier.
是喔，不過至少你們有上床

39
00:02:04,120 --> 00:02:05,640
Yeah,actually.
那倒是

40
00:02:06,120 --> 00:02:09,420
Meanwhile,I get Rachel shoving your underwear in my face...
瑞秋不僅把你的內褲 湊到我面前

41
00:02:09,590 --> 00:02:12,890
...and asking when she can come see me star in Ugly Woman.
還問什麼時候 可以看我演出醜女人

42
00:02:14,360 --> 00:02:15,730
We'll be more careful.
我們下次一定會更小心

43
00:02:15,960 --> 00:02:19,900
We don't want them to know because it's going really well.
因為我們實在太甜蜜了 所以不想告訴別人

44
00:02:20,640 --> 00:02:23,700
And maybe it's going well because it's a secret.
搞不好就是保密才能這麼順利

45
00:02:23,970 --> 00:02:27,460
It sounds weird, but we're so bad at relationships.
我知道你覺得很怪 但我們都不太會處理感情問題

46
00:02:27,880 --> 00:02:29,740
-We are. Help us! -Help!
沒錯，幫幫忙 拜託

47
00:02:31,680 --> 00:02:35,380
All right. But you do it with me once.
好吧，不過…你要跟我上床一次

49
00:02:39,620 --> 00:02:41,750
-Joey! -Didn't think so.
喬伊 就知道你不肯

50
00:02:44,660 --> 00:02:46,520
The One With Ross' Sandwich
本集播出：「真相不白」

00:02:44,660 --> 00:02:46,520
rainystar壓制iPod-MP4

51
00:03:32,270 --> 00:03:35,330
-Can we please just drop this? -But I don't get it.
不能換個話題嗎？ 可是我實在不懂

52
00:03:35,510 --> 00:03:39,380
Does anybody else just take off their underwear when they're hot?
別人一熱也會隨便 在朋友家脫內褲嗎？

54
00:03:41,921 --> 00:03:42,717
菲比

55
00:03:43,850 --> 00:03:44,910
What are you reading?
你在看什麼？

57
00:03:45,650 --> 00:03:46,640
Wuthering Heights.
「咆哮山莊」

58
00:03:46,850 --> 00:03:50,920
I have to finish it by tomorrow for my literature class.
我在紐恩大學上文學課 明天之前必須看完

59
00:03:51,160 --> 00:03:53,420
You're taking a class? That's so cool.
我不知道你在上課，真酷

60
00:03:53,800 --> 00:03:56,760
I really liked that Lamaze class I took.
上次上拉梅茲課很好玩

61
00:03:57,030 --> 00:04:00,690
I thought this time I'd go for something more intellectual...
所以我決定換種課來上 換點比較要用腦袋

62
00:04:01,000 --> 00:04:03,300
...with a less painful final exam.
期末考又不用那麼痛苦的

63
00:04:04,670 --> 00:04:06,200
That sounds like fun.
聽起來很有意思

64
00:04:06,540 --> 00:04:08,700
Oh,you should come with me!
你也可以一起來

65
00:04:08,940 --> 00:04:11,100
Then I'll have someone to sit with.
就有人可以跟我一起坐了

66
00:04:11,484 --> 00:04:12,473
好啊

67
00:04:13,450 --> 00:04:15,180
Do you have time to read it?
不過你有時間看書嗎？

68
00:04:15,380 --> 00:04:16,370
I read it in school.
我高中就念過那本了

69
00:04:16,650 --> 00:04:20,610
This is going to be so much fun! I have to finish.
一定很好玩 噓，先讓我看完

71
00:04:22,960 --> 00:04:25,360
But what time does the class start?
幾點要上課？

73
00:04:29,335 --> 00:04:31,064
嗨

74
00:04:31,930 --> 00:04:32,920
What's wrong,buddy?
你怎麼啦？

75
00:04:33,130 --> 00:04:35,530
Someone at work ate my sandwich.
有同事偷吃我的三明治

76
00:04:37,540 --> 00:04:39,560
What did the police say?
條子怎麼說？

77
00:04:40,580 --> 00:04:43,540
My Thanksgiving leftover sandwich.
那是感恩節剩下的三明治 

78
00:04:43,780 --> 00:04:45,640
I can't believe someone ate it.
竟然給人偷吃掉

79
00:04:45,880 --> 00:04:47,110
It's just a sandwich.
不過是個三明治嘛

80
00:04:47,380 --> 00:04:48,940
Just a sandwich?
不過是個三明治？

81
00:04:49,220 --> 00:04:51,120
I am 30 years old,okay?
我今年30歲，

82
00:04:51,390 --> 00:04:53,720
I'll be divorced twice and I got evicted.
已經離婚兩次 還沒地方可住

83
00:04:53,960 --> 00:04:57,150
That sandwich was the only good thing in my life!
那個三明治是我人生中 唯一美好的事情

84
00:04:57,390 --> 00:05:01,230
Someone ate the only good thing going on in my life!
結果唯一美好的事情 竟然給人偷吃掉

85
00:05:03,230 --> 00:05:04,490
That's a nice sweater vest.
這件毛線背心不錯

86
00:05:06,830 --> 00:05:09,100
I have enough for one more sandwich.
我還有材料可以再做一個三明治

87
00:05:09,340 --> 00:05:11,900
I was going to eat it myself,but....
我本來自己要吃…

88
00:05:13,340 --> 00:05:17,040
Mon,that would be incredible. Thank you so much.
太好了，真是謝謝你

89
00:05:17,510 --> 00:05:20,240
I still can't believe someone ate it!
我到現在還不相信有人偷吃了

90
00:05:22,420 --> 00:05:24,680
Look,I left a note and everything.
我還留了一張紙條在上面

91
00:05:25,890 --> 00:05:27,290
"Knock-knock." "Who's there?"
「叩叩叩」，「誰啊？」

92
00:05:27,560 --> 00:05:29,350
"Ross Geller's lunch."
「羅斯蓋勒的午餐」

93
00:05:30,260 --> 00:05:32,280
"Ross Geller's lunch,who?"
「哪個羅斯蓋勒的午餐？」

94
00:05:32,690 --> 00:05:36,390
"Ross Geller's lunch. Please don't take me. Okay?"
「這是羅斯蓋勒的午餐 請勿偷走我」

95
00:05:38,100 --> 00:05:40,360
I'm surprised you didn't wear it home.
你沒被扁就該偷笑了

96
00:05:42,200 --> 00:05:44,870
Want to keep your food? Scare people off.
不想讓別人偷吃你的東西？ 那就得嚇跑他們 

97
00:05:45,070 --> 00:05:46,630
I learned that on the street.
這是我在街頭流浪學到的

98
00:05:47,040 --> 00:05:48,030
Really?
真的？

99
00:05:48,610 --> 00:05:50,410
What would you say,Phoebe?
不然你怎麼說，菲比？

100
00:05:50,650 --> 00:05:54,740
Stuff like: "Keep your mitts off my grub."
例如「髒手少碰我的餿水」？

101
00:05:56,320 --> 00:06:00,780
Do you picture Phoebe on the street with the entire cast of Annie?
羅斯，你以為菲比 當年是在演溫苦女流浪記嗎？

102
00:06:03,420 --> 00:06:06,330
This'll keep them away from your stuff.
貼上這張紙條就沒人敢偷吃了

103
00:06:09,635 --> 00:06:11,034
哇

104
00:06:12,800 --> 00:06:14,770
Phoebe,you are a badass!
菲比，你真狠

105
00:06:16,300 --> 00:06:18,900
Someday I'll tell you how I stabbed the cop.
下次再告訴你們 我拿刀捅條子的事

106
00:06:19,840 --> 00:06:21,600
He stabbed me first!
是他先捅我的

108
00:06:25,680 --> 00:06:29,010
The Bronte sisters were remarkable women for their time.
布朗蒂姐妹是當代的傑出女性

109
00:06:29,320 --> 00:06:31,620
They lived in a patriarchal society.
當時是父系社會

110
00:06:31,850 --> 00:06:33,750
Sorry I'm late, but I left late.
抱歉遲到，因為我太晚出門

111
00:06:36,820 --> 00:06:39,420
So,what is the book about?
菲比，這本書在說什麼？

112
00:06:39,660 --> 00:06:41,360
Didn't you read it in high school?
你說你高中念過

113
00:06:41,600 --> 00:06:44,660
I started it,but then there was this pep rally.
對，後來我想起我開始看時 正好碰上要為球隊打氣

114
00:06:44,870 --> 00:06:46,660
And I was on top of the pyramid.
我又是啦啦隊隊長

115
00:06:47,170 --> 00:06:48,660
But anyway...
就是這樣啦…

116
00:06:48,870 --> 00:06:49,860
...what's the book about?
到底在說什麼？

117
00:06:51,140 --> 00:06:54,840
It's a tragic love story between Cathy and Heathcliff.
這是凱西跟希克裡夫的 悲慘愛情故事

118
00:06:55,110 --> 00:06:57,980
It takes place on these creepy moors in England.
故事發生在英國可怕的山莊

119
00:06:58,210 --> 00:07:02,310
Which I think represent the wildness of Heathcliff's character.
場景就代表 男主角性格中狂野的一面

120
00:07:02,550 --> 00:07:04,210
I totally get symbolism.
我對象徵主義很有一套

121
00:07:05,850 --> 00:07:08,880
How would you characterize the theme of this book?
這本書的主題是什麼？

122
00:07:09,120 --> 00:07:11,020
Let's see.... Rachel Greene?
看看找誰…瑞秋葛林

123
00:07:16,530 --> 00:07:20,400
I would have to say that it's a tragic love story.
這是個…愛情悲劇

124
00:07:21,000 --> 00:07:23,370
That's sort of a given...
非常明顯

125
00:07:23,570 --> 00:07:25,540
...but,yes. Anyone else?
不過你說得也沒錯 還有誰有意見？

126
00:07:26,840 --> 00:07:27,830
Symbolism!
還有象徵性的意義

127
00:07:30,880 --> 00:07:33,240
And the wildness of the moors...
狂野的場景…

128
00:07:33,510 --> 00:07:35,980
...which I think,is mirrored...
反映出 

129
00:07:36,220 --> 00:07:39,650
...in the wildness of Heathcliff's character.
男主角性格中桀傲的一面

130
00:07:41,160 --> 00:07:44,720
Excellent! What Rachel has shrewdly observed here....
非常好 瑞秋讀得相當透徹

132
00:07:46,230 --> 00:07:48,060
You completely stole my answer!
你根本就是照我說的回答

133
00:07:48,330 --> 00:07:50,060
Honey,that was pretty obvious.
親愛的，隨便讀讀就知道了

134
00:07:50,330 --> 00:07:52,560
How would you know? You didn't read it!
你哪曉得？你根本沒念過

135
00:07:54,570 --> 00:07:57,940
What do you think? You in the blue shirt?
你有何意見呢？ 穿藍襯衫這位同學？

137
00:08:00,610 --> 00:08:05,240
I think that yours is a question with many possible answers.
我認為這個問題 有很多可能的答案

138
00:08:06,680 --> 00:08:08,410
Would you care to venture one?
那就麻煩你舉出一個

139
00:08:09,180 --> 00:08:11,520
Would you care to venture one?
你願意說一個嗎？

140
00:08:13,120 --> 00:08:14,850
Are you just repeating me?
你是重複我的話嗎？

141
00:08:15,090 --> 00:08:17,610
Are you just repeating me?
你是重複我的話嗎？

142
00:08:19,860 --> 00:08:21,420
All right. Let's move on.
好吧，我們看下去

143
00:08:22,400 --> 00:08:23,390
Okay,then.
好

144
00:08:27,570 --> 00:08:29,930
Why didn't you say you hadn't read the book?
你為什麼不直接說你沒看過？

145
00:08:30,240 --> 00:08:32,640
I didn't want him to think I was stupid.
我不希望他認為我很蠢

146
00:08:32,910 --> 00:08:35,970
That was really embarrassing, what happened to you.
你看看你多糗 菲比 怎麼了？

148
00:08:40,650 --> 00:08:41,910
Your note?
你那張紙條

149
00:08:42,380 --> 00:08:43,370
Amazing!
真是了不起

150
00:08:43,920 --> 00:08:46,250
Not only did no one touch my sandwich...
不但沒人敢碰我的三明治 

151
00:08:46,490 --> 00:08:49,290
...but people at work are actually afraid of me.
而且還開始對我敬畏三分

152
00:08:49,820 --> 00:08:51,550
A guy called me "Mental."
還有人叫我瘋子

153
00:08:51,790 --> 00:08:53,260
"Mental Geller."
瘋子蓋勒

154
00:08:53,790 --> 00:08:56,560
I've always wanted a cool nickname like that.
我一直夢想有這種超酷外號

155
00:08:57,930 --> 00:09:01,490
The best you got in high school was "Wet Pants Geller."
以前你最酷的外號 就是「尿褲子蓋勒」

156
00:09:01,740 --> 00:09:03,500
It was the water fountain,okay?!
那是飲水機噴到的

157
00:09:05,640 --> 00:09:06,660
Anyway...
現在...

158
00:09:08,410 --> 00:09:10,400
...people are writing reports for me...
有人願意幫我寫報告

159
00:09:10,610 --> 00:09:13,140
...pushing back deadlines to fit my schedule.
我愛什麼時候交就什麼時候交

160
00:09:13,410 --> 00:09:15,610
I tell you, you get tough with people...
原來對人耍狠...

161
00:09:15,820 --> 00:09:18,610
...and you can get anything you want.
...就可以呼風喚雨

162
00:09:18,850 --> 00:09:21,820
Hey,Tribbiani! Give me that coffee! Now!
崔比亞尼，咖啡拿來

163
00:09:31,700 --> 00:09:33,260
This was really fun.
今天真有意思

164
00:09:34,770 --> 00:09:36,670
I've been wondering if you'd ask me out.
我本來還懷疑你會不會約我

165
00:09:36,970 --> 00:09:39,270
So you still wondering?
你還在懷疑嗎？

166
00:09:40,170 --> 00:09:42,340
No. We just went out.
我們已經去約會啦

167
00:09:45,510 --> 00:09:46,500
You're smart.
你真聰明

168
00:09:46,780 --> 00:09:48,610
I like that.
我喜歡

169
00:09:55,720 --> 00:09:57,350
Oh,candles!
還有蠟燭啊

170
00:09:59,460 --> 00:10:01,020
What is that,a blanket?
這是什麼？毯子？

171
00:10:01,300 --> 00:10:03,820
A video camera? Oh,my God!
攝影機？ 我的天啊

172
00:10:05,300 --> 00:10:10,400
I can't believe you thought you'd tape us having sex on the first date!
你竟然第一次約會 就想拍下我們上床過程

174
00:10:15,581 --> 00:10:16,673
你好

175
00:10:18,380 --> 00:10:20,540
Joey,is what she just said....
喬伊，她剛說的…

176
00:10:21,850 --> 00:10:23,040
Oh,my God!
天啊

177
00:10:23,320 --> 00:10:24,750
You're actually going
你還真打算…

178
00:10:29,660 --> 00:10:31,220
What is going on here?
這是怎麼回事？

179
00:10:33,860 --> 00:10:37,090
And with Chandler in the next room. What are you,sick?
而且錢德還在家 你是…你是變態嗎？

180
00:10:42,500 --> 00:10:43,870
I'm Joey.
我是喬伊啊

181
00:10:46,910 --> 00:10:48,740
I mean, I'm disgusting.
我本來就噁心

182
00:10:51,380 --> 00:10:53,610
I make low-budget adult films.
還拍低成本的A片

183
00:11:05,190 --> 00:11:07,180
You promised to be more careful!
你們答應我要更小心的

184
00:11:07,460 --> 00:11:10,520
The good Joey name's been dragged through the mud!
喬伊的好名聲都給你們毀了

185
00:11:12,770 --> 00:11:13,760
We're so sorry.
對不起 抱歉

186
00:11:14,000 --> 00:11:15,470
I'm telling everyone.
我要把你們的事情說出去

187
00:11:15,670 --> 00:11:20,470
It's the only explanation that doesn't make me look like a pig!
否則內褲跟攝影機的事情 只會讓人覺得我是變態豬玀

188
00:11:20,840 --> 00:11:22,500
No,there's a better explanation.
